      "Devotional reports, not Church declarations": 1,
      "Annaya is in the Jbeil district. The drive from Beirut is about 52 kilometers, usually around 90 minutes depending on traffic. The tomb is in the monastery church, and the hermitage is a short walk uphill. The monastery receives visitors daily; check opening times with the monastery before you travel. The 22nd of each month is the busiest day: Leo XIV described \"thousands of pilgrims from different countries\" coming that day. Plan your visit with": 1,
